.idea/

# Data pipeline: large/downloaded/generated artefacts stay out of Git (see DATA_INGESTION_GUIDE.md)
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
data/quality_reports/*.json
.cache/
*.tif
*.part
